Obrii Reticulum adapter

This directory contains Obrii's own packet interface, host RPC, framing,
process client, native LoRa bearer and tests. It uses the unmodified official
Reticulum Python package (rns==1.5.5) as a separately installed dependency.
It is not an independent implementation or a fork of Reticulum cryptography,
wire packets, routing, link establishment or resource transfer.

