The native bearer links ObriiLoRa. Preserve src/lora/NOTICE and
src/lora/LICENSE.LoRaPHY in distributions containing that library.

The OBRN radio envelope is an Obrii transport format, not RNode firmware's
on-air framing and not compatible with Meshtastic or LoRaWAN radio packets.

The optional RNode normal-mode radio envelope and chip profiles independently
implement the public wire behaviour of RNode Firmware 1.86:
https://github.com/markqvist/RNode_Firmware/tree/56775c51b60a6190242e324c210997dcc7637e53
The production module does not include or link RNode firmware implementation.
tools/generate_rnode_vectors.py can compile original GPL-3.0-or-later TX/RX
functions in a separate, ignored build/ test executable. That executable and
downloaded firmware retain upstream copyright/license and are not installed
with ObriiReticulumLoRa. Committed vectors are captured protocol test data.
